{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:40 2026-11-20 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:40 2026-11-20 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:40 2026-11-20 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d39ca8ad4dd96574c6201d716af0744/2026-11/012_2.png\"/><p>今日（20日）晚上8時許，一輛的士沿灣仔軒尼詩道西行，右轉入菲林明道時撞倒一名女途人。女子血流披面，倒卧地上，幸仍然清醒，救援人員接報到場替她包紮，並將她送往瑪麗醫院治理。據了解，女子過馬路時疑不依交通標誌橫過馬路，其後遭的士右邊車頭撞倒。</p><img alt=\"女子捱撞後倒卧地上。網上圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e713e799003dbc51a529d76257c97d0b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_21_15_45_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方在場調查。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/28f1fe5d2918ac51cca81ad64f4e5202/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_21_12_48_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方在場調查。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6be4027b78b66e7f0edb3e0906523f57/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_21_12_49.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"的士右邊車頭撞倒女途人。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5effa4a15f7420a13114aa12d60d1e30/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_21_12_48_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b85f2f4da78557959d529607abe2a233/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-20_at_21_12_48.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T14:03:58.451224+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T13:40:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T01:37:27.367291+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T13:57:24.069008+00:00","content_hash":"ed60674876392beb143bae01541361bb0e502dc0e5dcd3c42bb8e5f0cd17fef9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}